A1. A once famous dome. (Two words.) ~ TEAPOT
A6. A watering place. ~ TROUGH
A11. An evergreen tree. ~ YEW
A12. Antony's declaration to Cleopatra. ~ AMO
A14. These go with the "outs." ~ INS
A15. The great alibi. ~ IF
